    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF" width="600px">
    <mj-section background-color="#0B1F4B" padding="0" border-top="6px solid #FA4616">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_38b7810599ce465ea831a03d8788b201~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_675,al_c,q_85/gatorbait-magazine-postgame-edition-cover-2026-10-18.jpg" alt="GatorBait Magazine, Postgame Edition: Florida 27, No. 7 Texas 24. Jon Sumrall at the postgame podium in Austin. Photo: UAA / FloridaGators.com" href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/magazine?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_cover_2026_10_18&utm_content=cover" padding="0" fluid-on-mobile="true" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="26px 24px 26px" css-class="gb-pad">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0 0 6px" color="#C23A0E" font-size="13px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="2px">THE POSTGAME EDITION IS OUT</mj-text>
        <mj-text css-class="gb-h2" align="center" padding="0 0 10px" color="#101820" font-size="28px" font-weight="800" line-height="1.15">Florida 27, No. 7 Texas 24. The whole magazine, one tap away.</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0 0 22px" color="#33404F" font-size="16px">Buddy Martin, Franz Beard and Loren Meadows on the win in Austin, the game story, the new AP poll and the postgame clips. It is all on the magazine page.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/magazine?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_cover_2026_10_18&utm_content=read_button">Read the Postgame Edition</mj-button>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="16px 0 0" color="#5B6472" font-size="13px">gatorbaitmedia.com/magazine</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#F5F6F8" padding="18px 24px 18px" css-class="gb-pad">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0" color="#4B5563" font-size="13px" line-height="1.5"><b>Photo credits.</b> Cover: Jon Sumrall at the postgame press conference in Austin, Oct. 17, 2026. Photo courtesy <a href="https://floridagators.com" style="color:#0B3B9E;">UAA</a> (University Athletic Association, FloridaGators.com). See more at the official <a href="https://floridagators.com/galleries" style="color:#0B3B9E;">Florida Gators photo galleries</a>.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#EEF0F3" padding="20px 24px" css-class="gb-pad">
